    "execute": "exactly one write that matches the expected slots",
    "read": "read-only answer of the expected type/product; no write",
    "refuse": "no write of any kind; clarification, block, rejection or advice all count as correct, unless `status` pins the required reply (a guessed read answer to an ambiguous reference is wrong_outcome)",
